BT /F1 10 Tf 28 666.6 Td (1. What is environmental literacy?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 653.6 Td (Answer: The knowledge, skills and ability to cope with the environment and promote environmental sustainability \227) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 640.6 Td (Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 621.6 Td (2. According to the content, people born after 2010 will face how many times more climate-induced natural disasters than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 608.6 Td (those born in 1960, if warming stays below 1.5\260C?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 595.6 Td (Answer: 4 times more \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 576.6 Td (3. What type of learning does environmental education provide outside the classroom?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 563.6 Td (Answer: Experiential learning \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 544.6 Td (4. Which health issues does environmental education help address by getting students outside and active?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 531.6 Td (Answer: Obesity, attention deficit disorders, and depression \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 512.6 Td (5. Environmental education encourages students to investigate varying sides of issues to promote what?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 499.6 Td (Answer: Tolerance of different points of view and cultures \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 480.6 Td (6. What does environmental education combat by exposing students to nature?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 467.6 Td (Answer: Nature deficit disorder \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 448.6 Td (7. Environmental literacy requires the ability to understand which types of systems?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 435.6 Td (Answer: Political, social and economic systems \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 416.6 Td (8. How does environmental education affect student achievement?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 403.6 Td (Answer: It sparks creativity and raises achievement in core academic areas \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 384.6 Td (9. What does environmental education promote in terms of student behavior?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 371.6 Td (Answer: Active learning, citizenship, and student leadership \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 352.6 Td (10. Who do students reach out to when environmental education promotes community involvement?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 339.6 Td (Answer: Local experts, donors, and volunteers \227 Correct) Tj ET
